                                "sense_id": "bd98501b-cefd-3d97-aa19-c99174b737b8",
                                "text": "Rather than testify in open court, each sailor posted a davy before sailing off."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "05a76858-c0d9-4369-8e90-24cd358bfb84",
                                "sense_id": "bd98501b-cefd-3d97-aa19-c99174b737b8",
                                "text": "\"You and me should get on well, Hawkins, for I'll take my davy I should be rated ship's boy.\""
                            }
                        ]
